/T (Our Company, The Deep Sea Dogs, is based out of Allan Hancock College in Santa Maria, California. We are the only college level robotics program offered in our city and have hosted a broad range of students in their majors, experience, and career goals. Our mission is to provide STEM and robotics based education through competitive robotics programs to all students regardless of their experience level. )
/E (Our Company, The Deep Sea Dogs, is based out of Allan Hancock College in Santa Maria, California. We are the only college level robotics program offered in our city and have hosted a broad range of students in their majors, experience, and career goals. Our mission is to provide STEM and robotics based education through competitive robotics programs to all students regardless of their experience level. )
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [2]
>>
