<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (We outline our safety procedures and processes within our Company Safety Analysis and our Job Safety Analysis \(JSA\). Our company members are encouraged to wear PPE while working with the ROV and float components and test ROV functions in secure areas.  Since we are a small team we are able to look out for all of our teammates and provide them assistance with all tasks so no one has to take on any potentially dangerous tasks solo. )
/E (We outline our safety procedures and processes within our Company Safety Analysis and our Job Safety Analysis \(JSA\). Our company members are encouraged to wear PPE while working with the ROV and float components and test ROV functions in secure areas.  Since we are a small team we are able to look out for all of our teammates and provide them assistance with all tasks so no one has to take on any potentially dangerous tasks solo. )
