/T (Income: Income for our company is sustained through grants offered through MTS / MATE, Allan Hancock College, and community organizations. We have unique opportunities for fundraising through our college allowing us to fundraise at local businesses in their fundraiser night programs and through programs like SnapRaise which allows for us to invite potential donors to view our program. )
/E (Income: Income for our company is sustained through grants offered through MTS / MATE, Allan Hancock College, and community organizations. We have unique opportunities for fundraising through our college allowing us to fundraise at local businesses in their fundraiser night programs and through programs like SnapRaise which allows for us to invite potential donors to view our program. )
