/T (Our company uses every available event on our campus to advertise our product and mission. We participate in Allan Hancock Colleges Bulldog Bow-wow, Club Day, Earth Day, Diversity Day, and more to teach students about STEM / Robotics careers and opportunities our company has for them.  We participate in Allan Hancock Colleges Bulldog Bound events teaching local elementary school students about careers in STEM and agriculture. Through our outreach at AHC we have grown our reach to around 2000 local students. )
